            "review_title": "Review at Cowboy Jack's Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Malcolm P\nExeter, United Kingdom40 contributions\n0\nSaigon Center\nNov 2019\nIf u r related to Cowboy Jacks in the Saigon Center then this for u. After a day touring the city we went in the Center for a quick meal and what a load of rubbish it was. The staff need a full training by someone capable.\nMy wife ordered chicken and my self ribs, well I received my ribs and 20 minutes later my wife had her chicken and a further 10 minutes lapsed for her fries to arrive. NO APLOLOGIES OFFERED AND TO ADD INSULT I WAS CHARGED FOR 2 SERVIETTES TO WIPE HANDS WITH. NO FINGER BOWL FOR RIBS?????????????\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 11, 2019",
