            "review_text": "ilikefood01\nCarrickmacross, Ireland9 contributions\n0\nThe staff need babysitters\nJun 2019 • Couples\nThe staff consisted of teenage boys who were not professional, they obviously had no training, it's not their fault, there should be adult supervision. I ordered a burger with JUST CHEESE, I repeated this about 5 times in my order and checked the waiter understood. The burger came with sauce on the bottom and top bun (I'm allergic) I told the waiter I had only asked for cheese so he said he would fix it. He took me back the same burger with the sauce scraped off the buns. I told him I wouldn't eat that and he just looked baffled and didn't know how to handle the situation so he took the food away. Shocking service.\nRead more\nWritten June 28, 2019",
