            "review_text": "Antero\n51 contributions\n0\nDinner\nJan 2019 • Friends\nWe arrived to eat pizza and some steak with friends. First i ordered pizza and my \nfriends meat to share (only limited steak to order. Fries and burger was sold out:) ) ... after i made my order waitress said that pizza waiting time would be 40 min (kind of long time to wait), i walked to waitress and said i want to change my meal. Steak only took about 10min, but my 3 friends had to wait about 20min(we wondered why the meal came with the fries if they were sold out). Meat taste was ok, but nothing special too much sinew.\nRead more\nWritten January 30, 2019",
