            "review_title": "Review at Cowboy Jack's Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Simon W\nSingapore, Singapore211 contributions\n0\nGood Western Style Meal\nSep 2018 • Friends\nAfter 3 days of Vietnamese meal, I was craving for a good rack of pork ribs. I found it at Cowboy Jack's on L4 of Saigon Center. The restaurant was having a promotion on BBQ pork ribs and my friend and I went for it. The ribs was very well marinated and well cooked. The meat just peeled off the bones. Simply delicious. The set meal came with a salad, a corn cob and sweet potato fries...Very satisfying ! The mocktails were however pricey and not well blended. A great restaurant nevertheless.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 3, 2018",
