            "review_title": "Review at Cowboy Jack's Restaurant",
            "review_text": "annhien\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nNot worth it!\nFeb 2018 • Friends\nMy friend and I came her for lunch in February. It started out OK, we were shown to our seats in a jiffy - it was not that crowded, there were many empty seats. We ordered a salmon salad, crab pasta for my friend and mini burger set for me and a water melon juice. The drink was first to arrive after 10 minutes waiting, and things went downhill from there. The salad was so so. We had to remind the waiter twice for the main course. I was only informed that my mini burger set was sold out after asking for 3 times. In the end I had to order a crab pasta, which was cold, and tasteless, which is another surprise because they were all gloating about the crab pasta on their social media. Anyway, I definitely won't come back again. For those who are considering, proceed with caution.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 9, 2018",
